    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_e_08_question_02",
      "hash64": "475F06BAE5D7BE58",
      "text": "２　用「Ｒ鍵Let's Go」讓寶可夢去對戰，\\n　　這被稱為什麼？\\n\\n・請多對戰　　・隨意戰鬥\\n・自主對戰",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
